'''Bob''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'', turning Isaac into Bob after picking up 3 Bob-related items.

== Effects ==
* Isaac leaves a trail of [[Green Creep|green poisonous creep]] as he walks that deals {{dlc|nr}} 6 / {{dlc|r}} 20 damage per second.
* {{dlc|r}} Grants [[poison]] immunity.

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s or [[trinket]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags bob|{{code|bob}} tag]]).

=== Activated Collectibles ===
{{collectible table | Bob's Rotten Head }}

=== Passive Collectibles ===
{{collectible table | Bob's Brain, Bob's Curse, Ipecac }}

